  "stateOfPlay": "This week, we added three new hires identified at AMI, spanning London, New York, and Singapore; a dedicated talent-sourcing role posted in Paris; and newly surfaced seed investors, all of which point to a company moving from founding team to functioning organization. That operational push runs alongside a sustained public campaign by Yann LeCun — at VivaTech, RAISE, and ETH Zürich — hammering home the same thesis: LLMs have hit their ceiling, world models are the path forward, and Europe has a window. The two tracks are not separate; AMI is visibly staffing up to pursue the research agenda LeCun is loudly advertising.",
